# Narration Audio Files

Generated audio files will be placed here by the narration script.

Run `npm run narrate` from the promo/ directory to generate narration using ElevenLabs TTS.

## Expected files:
- `intro.mp3` - Scene 1 narration
- `satellite.mp3` - Scene 2 narration
- `how-it-works.mp3` - Scene 3 narration
- `marketplace.mp3` - Scene 4 narration
- `dashboard.mp3` - Scene 5 narration
- `outro.mp3` - Scene 6 narration
